; The exports the system dxgi.dll offers and that anything in this process may
; call. This dxgi.dll is loaded in its place, so every one of them exists here and
; is forwarded, or the process fails to start.
;
; Forwarder entries ("dxgi.CreateDXGIFactory") are not usable here: this module
; is itself called dxgi, so a forwarder would point at itself. Each export is
; therefore implemented in DxgiExports.cpp and resolved from the real system
; library's export table, through GetProcAddress where that has no entry.
LIBRARY dxgi

EXPORTS
    CreateDXGIFactory
    CreateDXGIFactory1
    CreateDXGIFactory2
    DXGIDeclareAdapterRemovalSupport
    DXGIGetDebugInterface1
